142
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:56,440
And in the case of accidents and incidents, the Biosrisk manager must determine root causes
对于事故和事件，生物风险管理者必须查明根本原因，

143
00:14:56,440 --> 00:15:03,190
and apply the pertinent corrective action.
并采取相应的纠正措施。

144
00:15:03,190 --> 00:15:11,110
The focus of every organization which is involved in the management of the risks associated
每个参与管理生物因子相关风险的组织，

145
00:15:11,110 --> 00:15:15,170
with biological agents should be on continual improvement.
其重点都应放在持续改进上。

146
00:15:15,170 --> 00:15:24,490
This is via ownership, periodic assessment, ensuring effectiveness and efficiency of standard
具体途径包括：落实责任、定期评估、确保标准

147
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:32,790
operating procedures, promoting preventing actions, focusing on continuous education and training,
操作规程的有效性和效率、推动预防措施、注重持续教育和培训、

148
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:42,910
setting goals for improvement, recognizing and rewarding employees.
设定改进目标，以及认可和奖励员工。

149
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:48,710
Let us move on now to the planning phase.
下面我们进入策划阶段。

150
00:15:48,710 --> 00:15:54,790
Planning involves risk assessment, hazard identification and risk management.
策划包括风险评估、危害识别和风险管理。

151
00:15:54,790 --> 00:16:01,950
This constitutes the basis of the AMP cycle which is based on risk assessment, risk mitigation
这构成了AMP循环的基础，AMP循环基于风险评估、风险缓解

