和绩效评估。

153
00:16:03,850 --> 00:16:14,950
I have discussed this cycle in the first lecture of this MOOC.
我在本慕课的第一讲中讨论过这个循环。

154
00:16:14,950 --> 00:16:22,320
Another aspect which is involved in planning is conformity and compliance.
策划涉及的另一个方面是符合性与合规性。

155
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:29,320
You must identify all relevant requirements and fulfill them within the scope of the
你必须识别所有相关要求，并在生物风险管理体系的

156
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,320
Biosrisk management system.
范围内满足这些要求。

157
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:36,920
There may be specific legal requirements which are dependent on your national, federal,
可能存在具体的法律要求，这取决于你所在国家、联邦、

158
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:41,920
