00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:54,220
committee which refers to or reports to the senior management.
委员会，它向高级管理层汇报。

178
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:58,420
At the base of this organization are the advisors.
这个组织的基层是顾问。

179
00:18:58,420 --> 00:19:05,220
The organization may have to call in special advisors to address specific requirements in
组织可能需要聘请专门的顾问来满足

180
00:19:05,220 --> 00:19:08,940
