生物安全和生物安保方面的特定要求。

181
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:18,480
The Biosrisk manager or the biosafety officer is a critical component of this hierarchy.
生物风险管理者或生物安全官员是这一层级结构中的关键组成部分。

182
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,600
Then we have the facility manager.
然后是设施经理。

183
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:27,780
The facility manager is an engineer who oversees the management of the facility.
设施经理是负责监督设施管理的工程师。

184
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:36,760
He or she will ensure the operation of the electrical, mechanical, heating, ventilation and
他或她会确保电气、机械、供暖、通风和

185
